{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "１０月２４日。", "text_idx": 542, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "过完周末，从星期二开始要正式进入期中考试了。", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我今天也来到濑名同学的家打扰，按照约定请她教我念书。", "text_idx": 501, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那里错了。要像这样，让这里更有效率……”", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，原来如此……嗯，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不客气。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为每天都来，所以已经很习惯濑名同学穿居家服的模样了。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甚至最近还开始觉得就是这种松懈的感觉才好。", "text_idx": 528, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我有尽量不用“男人”的眼光去看她就是了。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这方面是我跟樱乃相处下来得到的结论。", "text_idx": 539, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼。”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了？”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有……只是在想我已经很习惯家里有瓜生君在了呢。”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然这样说可能有点怪，不过不是习惯比较好吗？”", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是这样没错，但我心情很复杂。我为什么会在男生面前穿成这样呢？”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“身为男生的我很难回答你。”", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说……”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时濑名同学抬起头。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扫地毯的时候要先洒上泡过的茶叶在扫。这是女仆的智慧喔！”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0266", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想试看看。”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 514, "voice": "sk0343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我来了～今天也跟小纱凪一起喔！给你，呵呵，这是小点心。”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然今天也有垃圾虫存出现在学姐面前！爱理在干嘛啊，为什么穿成那样教他念书？你果然是迷上他了？”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0087", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我家已经完全变成聚会场所了。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说的一点也没错……", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且今天连乾同学都来了。", "text_idx": 534, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，乾同学那个，这样好吗？”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“都已经这样了，多一个纱凪也没什么……唉，是谁造成的啊，让我这样越来越没有底线。”", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪！我想你应该知道，要是把这件事说出去的话我可不会放过你喔！”", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么嘛，我才不怕爱理呢。因为我跟你认识最久了～”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0088", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算知道这种事我也不会幻灭的，等着看吧！我会对所有人都保密啦～”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0089", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪的口风很紧呢。”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请交给我吧，美羽学姐。”", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0090", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来如此，因为乾同学的这种个性，所以还在容许范围内啊。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且天羽学姐的影响也很大呢。", "text_idx": 535, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以就打扰啦。”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0091", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰了～我把点心放进冰箱里喔～”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～真是的！要坐的话拿坐垫……只有一个，所以随便铺个东西坐吧！”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0505", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果今天连乾同学也加入，大家一起念书了。", "text_idx": 531, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算没有约好，大家都主动带课本来爱理同学的家念书了呢。”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0267", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是没有空间所以有点挤。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 514, "voice": "sk0344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这不是我的问题吧？不喜欢的话就立刻回去！”", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0506", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一个星期以来不只是我，大家都会主动带书来念。", "text_idx": 538, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然了，有一部份的原因是濑名同学总是会帮忙指导遇到问题的人……", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之先集中精神１小时，知道了吗？好……开始！”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过濑名同学营造出的这种认真气氛非常关键。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一旦她开始率先念书，全员就不可思议地也集中精神起来。", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "绝对算不上宽广的３坪大空间中，大家肩并肩地……", "text_idx": 532, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──今天也努力用功到了日落时分。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哼嗯。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了天羽学姐的以外，濑名同学看了大家的笔记后用鼻子哼了一口气。", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看来大家都念得还不错呢……这样一来应该能考到不错的分数吧。”", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的很谢谢你，都是多亏了你的帮忙。”", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为很努力了嘛♪”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0268", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐～”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0174", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 514, "voice": "sk0345", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是突然叫我念书……我明明是来玩的……”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0092", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就先这样吧，我的课外辅导结束了。”", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天后天就各自做最后冲刺。知道了吗？”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后再补上一句激励，一个星期的密集用功在此时告一段落了。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……真是的，简直灾难。”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不只是私底下的生活被发现，在考试前的重要时期家里还变成大家的聚会场所……”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，真的累积了很多不顺呢。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，你不要在那边真的摆出很抱歉的表情啦！”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不是说过彼此彼此了吗？我才要谢谢，那个时候受你帮助了。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学害羞了。", "text_idx": 522, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了念书获得的成果以外……还有种成就感。", "text_idx": 541, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好！”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接着就休息一下吧，大家都辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是呢，都还没吃晚饭。”", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0269", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要做点什么吗？”", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 514, "voice": "sk0346", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么食材都没有……”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0516", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，天羽学姐带了小点心过来吧，那就先吃那个……”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0517", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;“……欸！？”", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "“……欸！？”", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0518", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学一打开冰箱，就发出奇怪的叫声。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，天羽学姐，这是……”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0519", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她拿出点心，回头问。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是蛋糕喔……咦？还有蜡烛。”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0175", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该、该不会是知道才、今天……”“是店里的人搞错了吗……”", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理／美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 527, "voice": "go037", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大概吧。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0177", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起看向濑名同学。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔！”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0521", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学转过身去背对我们。", "text_idx": 525, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会濑名同学……”", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么都没有！来休息吧！把盘子拿出来，这是今天的收尾了俐落一点！！”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……超可疑。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁。”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0093", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解了小纱。就是说啊就是说啊，就是那样呢～”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0270", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以爱理同学，请用宽～大的心包容安洁的无礼吧！”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0271", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁站起身，对濑名同学恭敬地深深低下头。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“蛤？安、安洁你做什么──”", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;扑上！", "text_idx": 10, "plain": "扑上！", "plain_idx": 509, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀、等、欸、住手、哇啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“女仆杀法搔痒之舞────！！”", "text_idx": 7, "plain": "“女仆杀法搔痒之舞────！！”", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0272", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“住手、喂、啊啊、不行、啊、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁像鸟一样跳起，凶猛地扑向濑名同学对她搔痒。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈、啊啊哈、不、呀、啊哈哈哈、不行住手啊啊、呀哈哈哈哈！”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学又笑又叫地挣扎，和平常给人的感觉差了十万八千里。", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拜托、住手、哈、啊啊哈、安洁快住手哈哈哈哈哈、呀、啊啊、啊啊哈哈哈哈哈！！”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0527", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻～只要落到安洁的手中，就算是爱理同学也会回到掉根筷子都笑到不行的幼稚年纪喔～～！”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0273", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不行、不行啊哈、要死、要死了、我不行、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈！”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0528", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说吧爱理！不然安洁会这样持续一整晚喔，大概啦！”", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0094", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我知道我知道了啦说就好了吧我说就是了！啊哈哈哈哈哈住手～～～！”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0529", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我去跟邻居道个歉吵到他们了吧……”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我实在不忍心看下去了……", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天１０月２４日是濑名同学的生日，的样子。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……………………”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "全员", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "go032a", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们都没沉默不语。", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又没有什么，那种事不用庆祝也可以，而且还在考试前，现在不是过生日的时候了……”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0530", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学嘟着嘴，满脸通红地碎碎念着。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瞒着大家或许不对，但是说出来不就像在逼你们吗？而且我今天本来是预定一个人过的……”", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0531", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说的或许是没错啦……", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……而且我跟妈妈住在一起的时候，不管什么纪念日也都没有庆祝……”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0532", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──原来如此。我们彼此面面相觑。这句话的震撼力不同凡响。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了压抑强烈情绪的紧绷低声。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然呼吸急促起来。", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以我没有特别──”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0533", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“不管了现在立刻就庆祝吧！”", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "“不管了现在立刻就庆祝吧！”", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我强硬地吐出一口气。", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学……一脸惊讶得无以复加的表情。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就……预备，来！”", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;“生日快乐～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "“生日快乐～～～～！！”", "plain_idx": 446, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "全员", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "go039", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之后。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们泡了茶，在蛋糕上插蜡烛，简单迅速地举办了生日派对。", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然也可以出门去采买一趟，打造出更热闹的庆祝……", "text_idx": 536, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但大家都已经忍不下去了。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0534", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "早一秒也好，想快点庆祝濑名同学的生日。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──她其实很想庆祝的。这种压抑我们都看出来了。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以早一秒也好，不让她有时间拒绝的速度。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个。”", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0535", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来～要先吹蜡烛吗？还是先干杯呢？选你喜欢的就好了～～♪”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "ag0277", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不是──”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0536", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没问题，那个草莓是爱理的。”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 514, "voice": "sk0349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、那个……”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0537", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“干嘛啦～反正是值得庆祝的日子，你也开心一下嘛～来来来，耶！”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 530, "voice": "sn0097", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、可是……”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0538", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样小爱理也在大人的阶梯往上爬一阶了呢～”", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "mu0180", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0539", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学渐渐地……因为不知所措和害羞，身体越缩越小。", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像个害怕的孩子一样。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过……”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我对濑名同学微笑。几乎就像反射性动作。跟刚才一样。", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许这跟濑名同学想办的完全不同也说不定。”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0540", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学看着我。", "text_idx": 524, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不是。”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0541", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呼。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像是松懈了下来一般，有点奇怪的表情。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这种的、也不错……”", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0542", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "微小不清的声音。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我举起杯子看着她。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来。”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 510, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0543", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学不好意思地笑了，跟我一样举起了杯子。", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家也笑着举起各自的杯子轻碰。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……”", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0544", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………谢谢。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 526, "voice": "ar0545", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
